  unitName: Metal Forger Chrome
  unitId: 60844
  unitNumber: 1153
  description: The younger brother of the last emperor of Bariura. A victim of numerous
    assassination attempts since childhood in the politically tumultuous Bariura
    Empire, Chrome spent his life living as shadow within the imperial court. During
    the time of the great war against the gods, he was named the commissioner of
    Bariura's special military force. Though a low ranking position for someone of
    his lineage, it is said that he chose this job for himself. He used his subordinates
    to gather valuable information from the shadows for the sake of the empire, though
    he always gathered any information having to do with his nieces by himself.
  summonDesc: Don't place too much faith in me. I'm here to fight for myself, not
    for the rest of the world.
  fusionDesc: Do you have someone precious to you? And the strength to protect them?Power...is
    a necessity.
